---
layout: changelog
title: "Encryption for every file size in Storage"
date: 2026-11-17
cover: /images/blog/announcing-encryption-for-every-file-size/cover.avif
tags: storage, security
---

Encrypted buckets now encrypt files of every size. Until now, files larger than 20 MB were stored unencrypted, even with encryption turned on.

Encrypted uploads are now about as fast as unencrypted ones, and reading part of an encrypted file is about four times faster. No code changes are needed.

Files larger than 20 MB uploaded before this change stay unencrypted until they're uploaded again.

